fix(dashboard): tighten panel title-to-content spacing (client + pro)

- CardContent kept its default pt-5 (the override only set px-6 pb-6), so the gap
  between a panel title and its content was pb-4 (16px) + pt-5 (20px) = 36px.
- Header pb-4 -> pb-3 and content pt -> pt-1 in both the client and professional
  dashboards, for a consistent, tight ~16px title-to-content gap everywhere.
- (Home category carousel already links each card to /buscar?categoria=<id> with
  drag-vs-click guarding — navigation verified, no change needed.)

